---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Forms from '../components/Forms.astro';
import Close from '../components/Close.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Couples counselling" description="Couples counselling in Victoria, BC and virtual across BC with Rachel Glover, RCC. Communicate better, feel closer and grow together.">
  <div class="wrap"><section class="pg-hero">
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Couples counselling</p>
      <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.2s">Communicate better.</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.36s">Feel closer. Grow together.</span></span></h1>
      <p class="lede rise" style="--d:.65s">You can love each other, be committed to your relationship and still find yourselves struggling. Couples counselling can help you understand what’s happening between you and learn how to do things differently.</p>
      <div class="rise" style="--d:.8s;display:flex;gap:14px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <Forms kind="two" />
  </section></div>

  <section class="band alt"><div class="wrap split2">
    <div class="reveal stack"><p class="eyebrow">Sound familiar?</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Maybe…</h2></div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <ul class="checks stagger">
        <li>You keep having the same arguments.</li>
        <li>Problems keep stacking up.</li>
        <li>Affection or sex has changed.</li>
        <li>Resentment has built up.</li>
        <li>You feel more like roommates than partners.</li>
        <li>Parenting, stepfamily life, money, family or other pressures are creating tension between you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body">Sometimes there isn’t one big problem. You just don’t feel as good together as you used to.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>


  <section class="band"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal" style="max-width:720px"><h2 class="b-h1 h2">What can we work on?</h2></div>
    <div class="areas stagger">
      <div><svg class="ic ic-talk" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="16" cy="32" r="4.5" fill="#CDB792"/><circle cx="48" cy="32" r="4" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="sp l1" d="M23 26a8 8 0 0 1 0 12" stroke="#CDB792" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="sp l2" d="M27 22a13 13 0 0 1 0 20" stroke="#CDB792" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="sp r1" d="M41 26a8 8 0 0 0 0 12" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.6"/><path class="sp r2" d="M37 22a13 13 0 0 0 0 20" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg><h3>Communication &amp; conflict</h3><p>Recurring arguments, defensiveness, shutting down, feeling unheard, and conversations that never seem to get anywhere.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic ic-close" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle class="g" cx="32" cy="32" r="14" fill="#CDB792" opacity="0"/><circle class="g g2" cx="32" cy="32" r="14" fill="#CDB792" opacity="0"/><circle class="g g3" cx="32" cy="32" r="14" fill="#CDB792" opacity="0"/><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="7" fill="#5C1A26"/></svg><h3>Closeness &amp; intimacy</h3><p>Emotional distance, changes in affection or sex, resentment, and feeling more like roommates than partners.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic ic-life" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M28 47L32 41L36 47Z" fill="#655247"/><g class="beam"><path d="M12 40H52" stroke="#655247" stroke-width="1.6"/><g class="sh"><circle cx="18" cy="34.5" r="4.5" fill="#CDB792"/><circle cx="46" cy="34.5" r="4.5" fill="#5C1A26"/><circle cx="26" cy="36" r="3" fill="#655247"/></g></g></svg><h3>Life together</h3><p>Parenting, stepfamily challenges, money, family boundaries, competing priorities, major decisions and life changes.</p></div>
      <div><svg class="ic ic-pattern" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" fill="none"><circle cx="28" cy="32" r="15" stroke="#CDB792" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><g class="orbit"><g class="dot"><circle cx="43" cy="32" r="5" fill="#5C1A26"/></g></g></svg><h3>Breaking old patterns</h3><p>Understanding the part each of you plays, managing your own reactions and changing patterns that keep pulling you back into the same place.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="band alt"><div class="wrap split2">
    <div class="reveal"><h2 class="b-h1 h2">What if my partner isn’t as interested in counselling as I am?</h2></div>
    <div class="reveal stack">
      <p class="body">It’s common for one person to be more interested in counselling than the other. You don’t both have to arrive equally enthusiastic or convinced that counselling will help. One person has the power to make significant shifts in the relationship.</p>
      <p class="body">What matters is a willingness to show up, be open to another perspective and take an honest look at what’s happening in the relationship.</p>
      <p class="body">My job isn’t to take sides or decide who’s right. I’ll work to understand both of you and help you identify what each of you can do to improve the relationship.</p>
      <p class="pull">You don’t have to be on the same page to start working on your relationship.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="b1-about">
    <div class="photo slide-up"><img src="/img/rachel-brick.jpg" alt="Rachel Glover, RCC, smiling, leaning against a brick wall" style="object-position:50% 6%" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
    <div class="txt reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">What to expect from me</p>
      <h2 class="b-h1">Think of me as your coach, translator and biggest cheerleader.</h2>
      <p class="body">I’ll help you understand what’s happening between you and make sense of what each of you is trying to communicate, especially when conversations get stuck.</p>
      <p class="body">I’ll teach you useful skills, challenge you when needed and be honest about what I see. Throughout the process, I’ll support and guide you, and be rooting for both of you and for the relationship you’re working to build.</p>
      <p class="body strong">You don’t have to know how to fix your relationship. You just need to be willing to work on it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band"><div class="wrap a1-fees">
    <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Couples sessions</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2" style="margin-top:16px">Session lengths and fees</h2></div>
    <ul class="fee-list stagger">
      <li><span class="what">Couples session</span><span class="len">60 min</span><span class="amt">$180</span></li>
      <li><span class="what">Couples session</span><span class="len">75 min</span><span class="amt">$225</span></li>
      <li><span class="what">Couples session</span><span class="len">90 min</span><span class="amt">$270</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <Close />
</Base>
